{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_12345","headline":"送李秀才落第游荆楚 · 钱起","name":"送李秀才落第游荆楚","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"翠羽虽成梦，迁莺尚後羣。\n名逃郄诜策，兴发谢玄文。\n昏旦扁舟去，江山几路分。\n上潮吞海日，归雁出湖云。\n诗思应须苦，猨声莫厌闻。\n离居见新月，那得不思君。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"钱起","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_12345.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_12345","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}